      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GETTING CHEEKY (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 19.92 beating On The Strip. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. Hard to go past. OUZO AND COKE (1) is better than last start when fifth (20.16) from Box 5 at this track over 342m. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Should be in this for a long way. RUSSO (8) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (20.19) at this track. Solid record here winning three races. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Winning chance. KOTA LAMBAI (2) is always a threat when she draws this box.",
